# lbl_mg5.mg5 -- photon-photon scattering, a loop-induced process, with the NLO UFO (research note models/spinor_qed,
# step (10)).  Run from Src/:   mg5_aMC lbl_mg5.mg5 > work/lbl_mg5.log   (run_lbl_check.sh does this)
# Imports a copy of generated/SpinorQED_NLO_MS_UFO in work/ (12 boxes and the two R2 vertices of the electron and muon loops;
# no counterterm contributes).  Two outputs:
#   MadLoop standalone of the squared loop amplitude ([sqrvirt=QED]; [noborn=QED] cannot be written as standalone code)
#     -> work/ml_lbl, evaluated per helicity by lbl_madloop_driver.f;
#   MadEvent for the loop-induced process ([noborn=QED]) -> work/me_lbl, launched by lbl_me_launch.mg5 after
#     run_lbl_check.sh adds the missing "Block loop" (MU_R) to its param_card (MadEvent otherwise looks for the Z mass).
set automatic_html_opening False
import model ./work/SpinorQED_NLO_MS_UFO
generate a a > a a QED=4 [sqrvirt=QED]
output standalone ./work/ml_lbl -f
generate a a > a a QED=4 [noborn=QED]
output madevent ./work/me_lbl -f
